  "body": "All Images Above Concept Only \r\n\r\nExperience the epitome of modern apartment living in this stunning new apartment located on Esmonde Road. Offering a perfect blend of convenience and sophistication, this apartment is situated close to both the North Shore and Auckland CBD, making it an ideal choice for those who value prime location and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nDesigned in the elegant 'winter garden' style, this 79 sqm (approx) apartment features 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom, and a versatile study. Additionally, the highly sought-after car park offers secure and convenient parking, and can be purchased together or separately from the apartment. The kitchen space is complemented by high-end Miele appliances, ensuring a touch of modern luxury in every detail. Not only is the apartment complex pet friendly, it will boast exceptional facilities, including a gym, cafe, restaurant, community boardwalk, community room, swimming pool, healthcare centre, and pharmacy. Designed by Jasmax, a leading sustainable architect and design practice in New Zealand, this building reflects a commitment to both style and sustainable responsibility. Enjoy easy access to local amenities, public transport, and major routes to both the North Shore and Auckland CBD, you are 2.3km away from Smales Farm, and a 14-minute (approx) walk away from Takapuna Beach. This apartment offers the latest in contemporary living. Don't miss out on the opportunity to make this luxurious space your new home!\r\n\r\nContact Harry Richards 021 0814 4513 or Lucy Hamilton 021 057 8099 for more information and to schedule a viewing.",
